{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/palm-beach-tower-1-nakheel-properties-dubai-marina","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":444,"crm_id":"1176","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Palm Beach Tower 1","slug":"palm-beach-tower-1-nakheel-properties-dubai-marina","display_address":"Dubai Marina","building_type":["apartment","penthouse"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Nakheel","price":5175000,"display_price":"5.175M","lattitude":25.1008434,"longitude":55.1549019,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Palm Beach Tower 1, a tower located on Palm Jumeirah Island, is the first building in the prestigious Palm Beach Towers development by developer Nakheel. The complex is designed in a modern urban style. The design of the towers was developed by a large company WS Atkins &amp; Partners. The complex includes residential apartments, stores, as well as a beach club with a park. Apartments are presented with <strong>1-4 bedrooms, as well as two-story penthouses with 4 bedrooms.</strong> All residences are exquisitely finished with premium quality materials. Apartments are equipped with balconies, which opens a gorgeous view of the coast.</p><p>Residents will enjoy a variety of recreational amenities including: yoga area, gym, playground and sports facilities, spa, private beach, waterfront park and promenade, outdoor infinity pool, observation deck, retail stores, lounge, cafe, multi-purpose room, indoor and outdoor children's play areas.</p><p>The development is located at the entrance to the iconic Palm Jumeirah Island, providing residents with easy access to the Dubai mainland. Within walking distance of the skyscraper are 2 streetcar stations - Palm Jumeirah 1 and Palm Jumeirah 2. Residents will have easy access to key areas of the rest of the emirate: travel time to Dubai Marina will take 10 minutes, and Business Bay and Downtown Dubai can be reached in 20 minutes. Dubai International Airport is 30 minutes away.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1176/images/2024/02/27/Av5SiWQrclMWSaUysZJkAordK4f7h8SqEtMJLbMw.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/27/Av5SiWQrclMWSaUysZJkAordK4f7h8SqEtMJLbMw.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1176/images/2024/02/27/24uSai0JsFx8dn6EYTQ8sX2YszR0nxheLyWP5FJ5.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/27/24uSai0JsFx8dn6EYTQ8sX2YszR0nxheLyWP5FJ5.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1176/images/2024/02/27/V4OWZlnpVXpaljAZg3uEjQCZa352REhDqAV3seOy.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/27/V4OWZlnpVXpaljAZg3uEjQCZa352REhDqAV3seOy.png","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1176/images/2024/02/27/euGefy9NG907YW2KPhUszksW91R4tNbUtAdUJFbp.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/27/euGefy9NG907YW2KPhUszksW91R4tNbUtAdUJFbp.png","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1176/images/2024/02/27/ponSlj8s5jlFxgA8IP8cuJR8kv4Mluu2fAC54m1S.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/27/ponSlj8s5jlFxgA8IP8cuJR8kv4Mluu2fAC54m1S.png","__ggfxIndex":4}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2071,"url":"","file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Brochure_c8098d43d8.pdf","hash":"Brochure_c8098d43d8","name":"Brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":{"id":1322,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1913,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null